  "configuration_id": "config_028",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_039) achieve high accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests replacing imagenet_vit_l with resnet50 image encoder while keeping RNA encoder, profile setting, and aggregation consistent. It isolates the impact of image encoder choice, a critical design decision, to determine if resnet50 offers comparable performance. This addresses uncertainty about the optimal image encoder and avoids changing multiple factors simultaneously."
}

